Helper Universal/Canonizer.lean: exists_codeCanonizer (the canonizer of
Turing.MachineFormat.exists_polyCanonizer at oneTapeMachineFormat, its specification read as
α ↦ (codeDecode α).serialize through the two readers) and
exists_effectiveMachineCode_canonizerTime_le (the scheme ⟨CodeTM.serialize, codeDecode,
codeDecode_serialize_pad⟩ with canonizerTime n = d·(n+1)^d ≤ d·2^{d n}). The owned file proves
exists_canonizerExp as ⟨c, d, d, h⟩, updates the target's docstring and sketch, the module's
status lines, Main results and Contents, and wraps six pre-existing lines over 100 characters.
